            "body": "my first attempt was this (failed)\r\n\r\n```\r\nlspconfig['csharp_ls'].setup({\r\n    handlers = {\r\n        [\"textDocument/definition\"] = function(...)\r\n            return pick.start({source = {items = cslsex.handler(...)}})\r\n        end,\r\n        [\"textDocument/typeDefinition\"] = function(...)\r\n            return pick.start({source = {items = cslsex.handler(...)}})\r\n        end,\r\n    },\r\n})\r\n```",
